ie</a> developed <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014).\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014) is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/hive/oryx/taken\" class=\"entity-link\">Taken</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014) is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/hive/oryx/taken\" class=\"entity-link\">Taken</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\" class=\"entity-link\">The Last City</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014) is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\" class=\"entity-link\">The Last City</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/hive/oryx\" class=\"entity-link\">Oryx, the Taken King</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014) is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/hive/oryx\" class=\"entity-link\">Oryx, the Taken King</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler\" class=\"entity-link\">The Traveler</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> (2014) is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/traveler\" class=\"entity-link\">The Traveler</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route th